# Architecture Rules

Falancé consists of:

- Telegram Bot
- Telegram Mini App
- Next.js backend
- AI provider layer
- Finance repository layer
- Google Sheets storage for v0.1
- Supabase as a future storage implementation

Use this conceptual architecture:

Interface
→ Application Logic
→ Domain/Services
→ Repository
→ Infrastructure

Do not put Google Sheets API calls directly inside Telegram handlers.

Do not put business rules directly inside UI components.

Do not make AI providers part of the domain model.

The repository abstraction must allow Google Sheets to be replaced by Supabase later.

Avoid premature abstractions when they do not support an actual requirement.